gx:CrosswalkLink a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "CrosswalkLink" ;
    rdfs:comment "An explicit, exact-key link between two objects of different identifier spaces (case, batch, deviation, CAPA, lab result, feed item, document). Created by a rule from a registered exact key, or by a human with a reason. Orphans stay orphans: no similarity matching." ;
